{"id":"71f0f60a7f89bf2e","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-measure9-stationary-process.md","title":"ZFC Measure9 Stationary Process","display":"df-zfc-measure9-stationary-process — ZFC Measure9 Stationary Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure9-stationary-process","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure9-stationary-process"],"display":"df-zfc-measure9-stationary-process — ZFC Measure9 Stationary Process","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-measurable-function]]","[[58-df-borel]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure9-stationary-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure9-stationary-process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure9-stationary-process — ZFC Measure9 Stationary Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space\">58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec B\\in V\">\\(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\\)</span> (real-valued measurable-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathrm{eucl}}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathrm{eucl}}\\)</span> (Euclidean topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\\)</span> (probability-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space\">58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9StationaryProcess}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9StationaryProcess}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9StationaryProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(X(n);\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall k,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^{k+1}\\;\\Bigl((\\forall i&lt;k\\;\\vec n(i)&lt;\\vec n(i+1))\\to\\forall\\vec B\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathrm{eucl}})^{k+1}\\;\\mathbb P(\\{z\\in\\Omega\\mid\\forall i\\leq k\\;X(\\vec n(i))(z)\\in\\vec B(i)\\})=\\mathbb P(\\{z\\in\\Omega\\mid\\forall i\\leq k\\;X(\\vec n(i)+m)(z)\\in\\vec B(i)\\})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9StationaryProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(X(n);\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall k,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^{k+1}\\;\\Bigl((\\forall i&lt;k\\;\\vec n(i)&lt;\\vec n(i+1))\\to\\forall\\vec B\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathrm{eucl}})^{k+1}\\;\\mathbb P(\\{z\\in\\Omega\\mid\\forall i\\leq k\\;X(\\vec n(i))(z)\\in\\vec B(i)\\})=\\mathbb P(\\{z\\in\\Omega\\mid\\forall i\\leq k\\;X(\\vec n(i)+m)(z)\\in\\vec B(i)\\})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Stationarity is equality of all finite-dimensional distributions under every time shift, tested on measurable rectangles; these form a determining <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>-system for the product Borel sigma-algebra.</li>\n<li>The former unsourced order and same-distribution predicates are eliminated.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}]